---
description: >-
  Two independently collapsed flow containers (tasks, more) chained by an
  edge, rendered with `look: handDrawn` to exercise the rough.js branch of
  collapsedGroup - including its separator and ellipsis rows - with more
  than one collapsed container present.
config:
  look: handDrawn
  handDrawnSeed: 1
---
%% Exercises the rough.js branch of collapsedGroup, including the separator
%% and ellipsis rows, with more than one collapsed container in the graph.
agentflow-beta TB
  flow tasks["Tasks"]
    t1["One"]@{ shape: task }
  end
  tasks@{ view: "collapsed" }

  flow more["More"]
    t2["Two"]@{ shape: task }
  end
  more@{ view: "collapsed" }

  tasks --> more
